WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.375
A quadrilateral is named by its properties.

2
00:00:04.002 --> 00:00:07.302
One pair of parallel sides: a trapezium.

3
00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:13.278
Move one corner. Two pairs of parallel sides and four right angles: a rectangle.

4
00:00:17.991 --> 00:00:21.441
It has every property of a parallelogram too.
